:"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/deployments","created_at":"2014-02-03T08:55:46Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T16:32:06Z","pushed_at":"2025-02-26T15:59:10Z","git_url":"git://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP","homepage":"","size":2453,"stargazers_count":36,"watchers_count":36,"language":"Makefile","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":8,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":126,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":8,"open_issues":126,"watchers":36,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Submitter: Will Law\r\nEmail: wilaw@akamai.com\r\nThe current version of the DASH specification does not provide a mechanism to implement \"forced subtitles\". A Forced Narrative (FN) subtitle is a text overlay that clarifies communications or alternate languages meant to be understood by the viewer. They can also be used to clarify dialogue, texted graphics or location/person IDs that are not otherwise covered in the dubbed/localized audio. To enable the same viewing experience across multiple countries and devices, FN subtitles are localized and delivered as separate timed ­text files. The picture in your primary video (A/V MUX) that would otherwise have subtitles is required to be delivered as a non-subtitled file, or textless. \r\n\r\nThis description from Netflix helps illustrate the use and need for forced subtitles:\r\n\r\nhttps://backlothelp.netflix.com/hc/en-us/articles/217558918-Understanding-Forced-Narrative-Subtitles \r\n\r\nAssume we are watching Star trek and it has 3 audio tracks in English, Spanish and French and subtitles in German. There is also a lengthy KIingon section of dialog in the video during which the director would like to show translations to the chosen language. The DASH manifest should then contain\r\n - Video (main role)\r\n - English audio adaption set (main role)\r\n - Spanish audio adaption set\r\n - French audio adaption set\r\n - German subtitle adaption set\r\n - English subtitle adaption set (forced)\r\n - Spanish subtitle adaption set (forced)\r\n - French subtitle adaption set (forced)\r\n\r\nWe require a means to signal in the manifest which subtitle adaptation sets are forced. Any time a subtitle title is annotated as \"forced\", the player is required to download and display it. While we cannot force client behavior from the manifest, we still have the requirement to signal these subtitle sets appropriately. ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/issues/165/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dash-Industry-Forum/DASH-IF-IOP/issues/165/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":5671784606,"node_id":"AE_lADOAT2ozs4_WRy-zwAAAAFSEJCe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/5671784606","actor":{"login":"icbaker","id":1279752,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279752?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker","html_url":"https://github.com/icbaker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/i